{"id":"qa_d6cdafa34be7","messages":[{"content":"每次启动前必须完成哪些检查？","role":"user"},{"content":"1. 确认冷却塔补水阀处于开启状态，水箱液位不低于最低刻度线；2. 检查散热通道无堵塞，过滤网压差不超过150Pa；3. 确认急停按钮已复位，KM1与KM2触点无粘连；4. 记录环境温度，若低于5℃应先启用曲轴箱加热15分钟。","role":"assistant"}],"metadata":{"chunk_id":"chk_36e1de0c0afa","evidence":"每次启动前必须完成下列检查：1. 确认冷却塔补水阀处于开启状态，水箱液位不低于最低刻度线。2. 检查散热通道无堵塞，过滤网压差不超过 150 Pa。3. 确认急停按钮已复位，KM1 与 KM2 触点无粘连。4. 记录环境温度。若环境温度低于 5℃，应先启用曲轴箱加热 15 分钟。","filter_trace":{"evidence_substring":{"action":"pass","ok":true},"exact_hash_dedup":{"dup":false},"grading":{"mode":"none"},"roundtrip":{"mean":0.9633,"ok":true,"sims":[0.9633,0.9633,0.9633]},"rule_clean":{"action":"pass"}},"generation_trace":{"anchor":"","cot_enabled":false,"evol_level":0,"evolution_type":null,"generation_timestamp":"2026-09-29T06:31:53.360932+00:00","hard":false,"q_type":"procedural","teacher_model":"qwen3.8-27b"},"goal":"qa","grade":null,"judge_overall":null,"judge_scores":{},"kb_gain":null,"kind":"步骤说明","location":"chk_36e1de0c0afa","nli_score":null,"q_type":"procedural","review_history":[{"at":"2026-09-29T06:31:53.361090+00:00","cot":false,"stage":"distillation","strategy":"write","teacher_model":"qwen3.8-27b"},{"action":"pass","at":"2026-09-29T06:32:00.017639+00:00","stage":"filter","strategy":"rule_clean"},{"at":"2026-09-29T06:32:00.164488+00:00","ok":true,"stage":"filter","strategy":"evidence_substring"},{"at":"2026-09-29T06:33:30.147638+00:00","mean":0.9633027522935779,"ok":true,"stage":"filter","strategy":"roundtrip"}],"source":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","source_file_id":null,"teacher_model":"qwen3.8-27b"},"split":"train"}
